: Handling Application Rollbacks
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand rollback strategies and mechanisms in Argo CD
Configure rollback settings for applications
Execute rollbacks to previous application states using Git history
Monitor and verify rollback operations
Implement best practices for application version management
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with Git version control system
Knowledge of YAML file structure
Basic Linux command-line skills
Understanding of containerized applications
