Issue 2: Application Stuck in Progressing State
Problem: Application remains in "Progressing" state after rollback

Solution:

# Force refresh
argocd app get rollback-demo-app --refresh --hard-refresh

# Manual sync
argocd app sync rollback-demo-app --force

# Check for resource conflicts
kubectl get events -n demo-app --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'
